docs {
  # Admin Dashboard API

  ## Endpoints

  | Method | Path | Name |
  |--------|------|------|
  | GET | /api/admin/dashboard/stats | stats |
  | GET | /api/admin/dashboard/skema-stats | skema-stats |
  | GET | /api/admin/dashboard/prodi-stats | prodi-stats |
  | GET | /api/admin/dashboard/recent-activity | recent-activity |
  | GET | /api/admin/dashboard/tahun-options | tahun-options |

  ## Auth & Permission
  - Authentication wajib
  - Permission: `view_admin_dashboard`
}
